<title>CHINA: China Jan-March tin exports up 141.5 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-March tin exports up 141.5 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought tin and tin alloys were 10,431 tonnes in the first three months, up 141.5 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	  EXPORTS JAN-MARCH     MARCH     YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGD</p>
<p> Tin	10,431		  5,096	+141.5</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
